+ * St inherits `color` and `text-shadow` from the theme node's parent, so the
+ * surface root carries both for every label beneath it. `icon-shadow` does
+ * not inherit (st_theme_node_get_shadow looks it up with inherit FALSE), so
+ * chrome glyphs take it from one descendant rule; dock artwork keeps its own
