+// Ink belongs to the appearance mode, not to the widget. Two modes are opaque
+// and take the ink the paper can carry; two are translucent and take white ink
+// over a smoked veil plus a shadow, because a light veil cannot carry white
+// ink at any shadow strength: white on the milky frost this replaced measured
+// 1.08:1, and 1.59:1 even under a fully opaque 6px shadow.
+//
