+// chrome glyphs, `ink2` the secondary line (dates, subtitles, source names),
+// `accent` a glyph that has to stay recognisably amber, and `line` one
+// hairline. `recess` is the inset the Well sinks its glyphs into, and `hover`
+// and `press` are the one interaction pair every shelf target uses.
